Package: cachearoo
Version: 1.0.9
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: systemd
Maintainer: Stinky Computing <info@stinky.tv>
Description: Cachearoo - High-performance caching server
 Cachearoo is a high-performance, configurable caching server
 that provides fast data storage and retrieval capabilities.
 This package includes an embedded Node.js runtime and runs
 as a systemd service on port 4300.
